    feat(metrics): wire host-aware feeder + per-solve observability (DF-OFF-BY-ONE-32)
    
    - Add MemoryProbe to cron loop: checks /proc/meminfo for host memory pressure
    - Add Sampler interface + ProcSampler: reads VmHWM from /proc/<pid>/status
    - Wire Sampler into solver.Config: captures peak RSS per solve
    - Add /metrics endpoint: exposes Observer snapshot (skips, solves, host stats)
    - Add over-budget alert: logs ERROR when peak RSS exceeds threshold
    - Add tests for memory probe, sampler, and metrics observer
    
    ch:trace row=DF-OFF-BY-ONE-32 witness=commit:HEAD
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
